  "description": "Apartment 11, Kirkwood, Park Avenue, Sandymount, Dublin 4\n\n€2,900 per month | Fully Furnished | Communal Parking\n\nBennetts Auctioneers are delighted to present this exceptional two-bedroom apartment in the highly sought-after Kirkwood development on Park Avenue, one of Sandymount’s premier residential addresses.\n\nRecently fully renovated and tastefully decorated to an exceptional standard, Apartment 11 is an immaculately presented residence offering a wonderful blend of contemporary luxury, comfort and timeless elegance. Extending to approximately 75 sq. m., the property has been meticulously upgraded throughout and is presented in turnkey condition.\n\nThe bright and spacious accommodation comprises a welcoming open-plan living, dining and kitchen area, designed for modern living and entertaining. The stylish living space features new wooden  flooring and an Ignite linear fireplace, creating a warm and sophisticated atmosphere. The bespoke contemporary kitchen is finished with premium cabinetry, new countertops and integrated appliances, while double-glazed windows throughout enhance comfort and energy efficiency.\n\nThe accommodation further includes two generously proportioned bedrooms and a beautifully appointed bathroom, all finished to an exceptional standard with high quality fixtures and fittings.\n\nExternally, residents benefit from superbly maintained communal gardens, a secure bicycle storage facility and a communal car park.\n\nKirkwood enjoys an unrivalled location on Park Avenue, one of Sandymount's most prestigious addresses, just a short stroll from the heart of Sandymount Village. An excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques and local amenities are on the doorstep, while Sandymount Strand is within easy walking distance. The area is renowned for its excellent sporting and recreational facilities, including Railway Union Hockey Club, Monkstown Rugby Club, Pembroke Cricket Club and West Wood Club.\n\nThe property is exceptionally well connected, with Sandymount and Sydney Parade DART stations nearby, numerous bus routes serving the area, and easy access to the East Link Bridge, Port Tunnel, Dublin Airport and Dublin City Centre.\n\nThis superb apartment offers a rare opportunity to secure a fully renovated and fully furnished home in one of Dublin 4's most desirable locations. \n\nAvailable immediately on a 12-month lease.",
